            <span>Total</span>
            <span>$24.99</span>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top: 24px; padding: 14px; background: #0c0b0a; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px dashed var(--border); font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
